run_config.prompt_template:
Educational text: {text}
Domain: {domain}
Audience: {audience}

Extract 1-3 key scenes from this educational content that would be valuable to visualize in 3D for the specified audience. Each scene should help illustrate an important concept from the text.

For each scene provide:
1. A short name (5 words max)
2. A detailed description (2-3 sentences)

Format your response as a JSON array of objects with 'name' and 'description' keys. Example:
[
  {
    "name": "Cell Membrane Structure",
    "description": "A detailed cross-section of a cell membrane showing the phospholipid bilayer with embedded proteins. The membrane should show both channel and receptor proteins with the extracellular and intracellular sides clearly differentiated."
  }
]

Scene Name: {name}
Scene Description: {description}
Domain: {domain}
Audience: {audience}

Refine this scene description into a detailed prompt for 3D model generation. Focus on clarity, specific details, and educational value. The prompt should be detailed enough for an AI to generate an accurate 3D model.

Considerations for audience '{audience}':
- Kids: Simple, colorful, engaging visuals with basic labels
- Teens: More detailed models with clear educational labels
- College: Accurate scientific models with proper terminology
- Professional: Highly detailed models with precise measurements and annotations

Provide your refined prompt as a single paragraph.
